	(text "ROM SRAM + bus-ownership glue"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.5) (bold yes))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2c2e6ac5-dba5-5692-bae5-b00ea561da54")
	)
	(text "BUS OWNERSHIP (single GPIO BUS_ESP, pulled HIGH = ESP owns bus at power-up)\nBUS_ESP=0 (SNES plays): U2-U4 drive SA*, U5 passes data when ROM_SEL_N=0,\n   SRAM /CE=ROM_SEL_N, /OE=SNES /RD, /WE=SNES_WE_N (only if MENU_WE_N=0).\nBUS_ESP=1 (ESP loads): U9-U11 drive SA*, U12 drives SD* when DOUT_OE_N=0,\n   ROM /CE=EA19, save /CE1=NOT EA19, /OE=ESP_OE_N, /WE=ESP_WE_N. U13 reads SD* back via SPI MISO.\nLoROM decode: ROM_SEL_N = /ROMSEL OR NOT A15. SNES A16-A19 -> SRAM A15-A18.\nWrites: SNES_WE_N = /WR OR (SAVE_SEL_N AND (ROM_SEL_N OR MENU_WE_N)) -> save area always, ROM area only in menu mode.\nU8 is AHCT: it sits in the /ROMSEL -> SRAM /CE path and saves ~24 ns against an HCT157 (FastROM)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 21.49 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.5 1.5))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2bbe8129-a816-536a-8e32-f70e0d17df50")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
